 "name": "central_california_map",
 "description": "Regional map of central California in the world_map/south_africa_map style (flat green land, dark outline, light-blue sea, white wave ticks, black frame, no labels, no pins). Projection lon -124.0..-121.2, lat 36.6..38.4, 400 px/deg, 1120x720, anchor centre at lon -122.6 / lat 37.5: x = (lon + 122.6) * 400, y = -(lat - 37.5) * 400. Shows Point Reyes, the Golden Gate (widened slightly so it reads) opening into San Francisco Bay and San Pablo Bay, the coast south past Half Moon Bay to Ano Nuevo Point and the top of Monterey Bay (bottom right). Farallon Islands rock group centred (-160,-80); Ano Nuevo Island dot at (108,156). Frame x -560..560, y -360..360.",
